      "content": "but therapy doesnt change the fact that my life is already decided. i'm just following a script written by everyone else. it's like i'm living in a cage and no matter how much i try to \"reclaim my identity,\" the walls just stay exactly where they are. there's no real freedom here, just different ways to pretend.",
